    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Blindness of both eyes with no light perception since an illness at 19 months; part of lifelong deafblindness, linked to the documented 1882 illness: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Profound bilateral deafness since the same illness; part of lifelong deafblindness, linked to the documented 1882 illness: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Wears an artificial eye: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Fall at home without injury, with reduced leg strength and balance on testing; increased fall risk: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

