<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.10" extension="2014-06-09"/>
    <code code="18776-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Plan of care note"/>
    <title>Plan of Treatment</title>
    <text><list><item>Fall evaluation by CDC STEADI: fall history, Timed Up and Go, 30-second chair stand, four-stage balance test, orthostatic blood pressure, medication review, feet and footwear, and vitamin D. Guideline: STEADI (Stopping Elderly Accidents, Deaths and Injuries): Clinical Resources (2024); Falls Prevention in Community-Dwelling Older Adults: Interventions (2024) [S]</item><item>Geriatric medicine consultation for a comprehensive geriatric assessment adapted for deafblindness, including fall risk, cognition, and future care planning. Guideline: STEADI (Stopping Elderly Accidents, Deaths and Injuries): Clinical Resources (2024); Zhou SY, et al. Training Medical Students in Deaf, DeafBlind, and Hard-of-Hearing Patient Care Through Interactive Lecture and Simulation. MedEdPORTAL 2025;21:11566 (2025) [S]</item><item>Communication access: the clinic books and pays for a qualified tactile interpreter for every visit, she chooses the method, staff do not rely on her assistant to interpret, appointments are double length, and all documents are given in braille and accessible electronic text. Guideline: Zhou SY, et al. Training Medical Students in Deaf, DeafBlind, and Hard-of-Hearing Patient Care Through Interactive Lecture and Simulation. MedEdPORTAL 2025;21:11566 (2025) [S]</item><item>Bone density screening by DXA, with FRAX risk, dietary calcium and vitamin D advice, and treatment only if risk reaches the treatment threshold. Guideline: Osteoporosis to Prevent Fractures: Screening (2025) [S]</item><item>Protect touch and skin: check hand and foot sensation, skin, and the artificial eye socket at each preventive visit, and see the ocularist yearly to polish the prosthesis. Guideline: STEADI (Stopping Elderly Accidents, Deaths and Injuries): Clinical Resources (2024); Medicare Wellness Visits (Medicare Learning Network) (2026) [S]</item><item ID="referral-order">Referral to geriatric medicine, Ezra Mwangi, MD, ordered 2026-03-09 [S]</item></list></text>

